{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object nearby, then take it, check its properties and perform task, otherwise scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObjectTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <SubTree ID = ScanObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = MoveToLocation    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <Action ID = IsObjectApproached    />\"",
